    "required_age": "18",
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Founding of Valtoria marks the beginning of this epic journey, focusing on King Valenor the Bold as he unites scattered human tribes into the fledgling kingdom of Valtoria. From strategic battles and diplomatic maneuvers to deadly threats from orc raiders and dark elven assassins, every choice you make will leave a lasting impact on the kingdom's foundation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episodic Storytelling: Experience the grand history of Omnivael through interconnected episodes, each spotlighting a defining moment in the realm's timeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Gameplay: Engage in strategic combat, political negotiations, and decision-making that shapes the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich Themes: Explore timeless tales of unity, leadership, betrayal, and the forging of alliances as you navigate the challenges of each era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive World-Building: Witness Omnivael\u2019s deep lore unfold with every episode, unveiling the legends and struggles that forged its legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an unforgettable journey through the Chronicles of the Realm, where every choice matters, and every episode deepens your connection to the world of Omnivael.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Founding of Valtoria marks the beginning of this epic journey, focusing on King Valenor the Bold as he unites scattered human tribes into the fledgling kingdom of Valtoria. From strategic battles and diplomatic maneuvers to deadly threats from orc raiders and dark elven assassins, every choice you make will leave a lasting impact on the kingdom's foundation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episodic Storytelling: Experience the grand history of Omnivael through interconnected episodes, each spotlighting a defining moment in the realm's timeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Gameplay: Engage in strategic combat, political negotiations, and decision-making that shapes the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich Themes: Explore timeless tales of unity, leadership, betrayal, and the forging of alliances as you navigate the challenges of each era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive World-Building: Witness Omnivael\u2019s deep lore unfold with every episode, unveiling the legends and struggles that forged its legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an unforgettable journey through the Chronicles of the Realm, where every choice matters, and every episode deepens your connection to the world of Omnivael.</p>",
